@startuml
title Flux CI/CD LaPince: Feature -> PR -> Develop (Update & Release) -> Main (Prod)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Developer
actor Reviewer
participant "GitHub Repo" as Repo
participant "CI: PR Checks\n(pr-checks.yml)" as CI_PR
participant "CI: Develop Pipeline\n(develop-pipeline.yml)" as CI_Dev
participant "Registry NPM\n(GitHub Packages)" as NPM
participant "Portainer\n(Production)" as Portainer

== 1. Phase Développement & Validation (Feature Branch) ==
Developer -> Repo: Push code & Open PR (target: develop)
activate CI_PR

parallel
    group Quality Gates (Automatisé)
        Repo -> CI_PR: Detect changes (Paths Filter)
        CI_PR -> CI_PR: Lint & Build (Check compilation)
        CI_PR -> CI_PR: Tests (Unit/Int) sur modules modifiés uniquement
        CI_PR -> CI_PR: SonarQube Scan
    end

    group Human Review
        Reviewer -> Repo: Review Code
        opt if Reviewer approves
             Reviewer -> Repo: Add label "auto-merge"
        end
    end
end

CI_PR --> Repo: Status Checks (Pass/Fail)

alt Checks OK + Review OK
    Repo -> Repo: Merge PR into `develop`
    deactivate CI_PR
else Checks Failed / Request Changes
    Repo -> Developer: Notification (Fix required)
end

== 2. Phase Intégration & Propagation (Branch Develop) ==
Repo -> CI_Dev: Trigger on push `develop`
activate CI_Dev

CI_Dev -> CI_Dev: Full Audit (Lint, Test All, Sonar Full)

group DTO Strategy: Propagation de la source de vérité
    note right of CI_Dev
        Si les DTOs ont changé, 
        on doit mettre à jour tout le monde.
    end note
    
    CI_Dev -> CI_Dev: Build Shared DTO Library
    CI_Dev -> NPM: Publish new version (@org/shared-dtos)
    
    CI_Dev -> CI_Dev: Update dependent package.json \n(npm install @org/shared-dtos@latest)
    CI_Dev -> Repo: Commit & Push updates (package.json + lockfiles) \n**[skip ci]**
end

group Artifacts & Release
    CI_Dev -> CI_Dev: Docker Build & Push (Services + Front)
    note right: Le build Docker utilise maintenant\nles versions DTO mises à jour juste avant.
    
    CI_Dev -> CI_Dev: Semantic Release (Calcul version, Changelog)
end

alt Pipeline Success
    CI_Dev -> Repo: Push Git Tag & Changelog
    CI_Dev -> Repo: Fast-forward Merge `develop` -> `main`
    deactivate CI_Dev
    
    == 3. Phase Déploiement (Production) ==
    Repo -> Portainer: Webhook Trigger (Update Services)
    Portainer -> NPM: Pull Docker Images (:latest)
    Portainer -> Portainer: Restart Containers
else Failure
    CI_Dev -> Developer: Alert (Broken Pipe)
end

@enduml
